B.am0=new A.mw("haberdashery",3,"Haberdashery","Shirts, mugs, badges and patches.\n\nSizes and photos belong on the product. Supplier details stay in the portal and are never sent to a hasher's phone, so the printer's phone number is safe to keep here.",B.I4,2,"haberdashery")
